# Realtime Features

- Use Socket.IO only for live kitchen and order boards. Create, update, and delete stay on REST.
- Authenticate the handshake with the Better Auth session (cookies). Disconnect sockets with no session.
- Join rooms from the server after checking the role. Do not trust a client-supplied room name.
- Emit an event only after the matching database write succeeds.
- Clients must not emit kitchen status, payment, refund, or inventory events.

```javascript
io.use(async (socket, next) => {
  const session = await auth.api.getSession({
    headers: fromNodeHeaders(socket.handshake.headers),
  });
  if (!session?.user) return next(new Error("Unauthorized"));
  socket.user = session.user;
  next();
});
```

- Share the HTTP CORS origin. Do not leave the socket server open to every origin.
